er follows modern Jones chronology; not substituted for received witness clocks."}},{"id":"bible:theographic:shallum_2526","nativeName":"Shallum","name":"Shallum","aliases":[],"unit":"Curated Biblical named-entity/person record","sourceRecordKey":"shallum_2526","sourceRecordOrdinalOneBased":2508,"sourceRefs":["theographic:CSV/People.csv"],"verseRefs":["Jer.35.4"],"genderAsCurated":"Male","ambiguousAsCurated":true,"disambiguationNote":"The son of Jabesh, otherwise unknown. He \"conspired against Zachariah, and smote him before the people, and slew him, and reigned in his stead\" ( 2 Kings 15:10 ). He reigned only \"a month of days in Samaria\" ( 15:13 , marg.). Menahem rose up against Shallum and put him to death ( 2 Kings 15:14 2 Kings 15:15 2 Kings 15:17 ), and became king in his stead. Keeper of the temple vestments in the reign of Josiah ( 2 Kings 22:14 ) One of the posterity of Judah ( 1 Chronicles 2:40 1 Chronicles 2:41 ). A descendant of Simeon ( 1 Chronicles 4:25 ). One of the line of the high priests ( 1 Chronicles 6:13 ). A keeper of the gate in the reign of David ( 1 Chronicles 9:17 ). A Levite porter ( 1 Chronicles 9:19 1 Chronicles 9:31 ; Jeremiah 35:4 ).","generation":null,"absoluteChronology":null,"musicalAssignment":null,"historicalIndividualIndependentlyConfirmed":false,"curatedChronologyNotAdopted":{"birthYear":"","deathYear":"","basis":"Maintainer follows modern Jones chronology; not substituted for received witness clocks."}},{"id":"bible:theographic:shallun_2527","nativeName":"Shallun","name":"Shallun","aliases":[],"unit":"Curated Biblical named-entity/person record","sourceRecordKey":"shallun_2527","sourceRecordOrdinalOneBased":2509,"sourceRefs":["theographic:CSV/People.csv"],"verseRefs":["Neh.3.15"],"genderAsCurated":"Male","ambiguousAsCurated":false,"disambiguationNote":"","generation":null,"absoluteChronology":null,"musicalAssignment":null,"historicalIndividualIndependentlyConfirmed":false,"curatedChronologyNotAdopted":{"birthYear":"","deathY